    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Visions: Chapter 1</strong> is not a traditional horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no save files.<br>No skip buttons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>narrative horror experience</strong>, not a survival challenge.<br>You\u2019re not here to escape. You\u2019re here to witness.<br><br>Developed entirely by <strong>one person</strong>, not a team, in 1 Month as a Challenge.<br>If you're expecting a AAA horror game, you\u2019re in the wrong place.<br><br>If you're ready for <strong>something different</strong>, press play.<br> <br><strong>Chapter One</strong> introduces the beginning of the Nightmare Visions <strong>anthology</strong>. Each chapter explores a new character, a new setting, and a new psychological thread woven into the same unnerving universe. <strong> </strong><br> <br> <br><strong> </strong><br> <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681480/extras/f08cb17929161696430d47956350c9c2.avif?t=1748654991\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br>This is not a game of combat or escape. It is a slow-burning descent into an atmosphere of unease, where story and tension unfold through exploration and observation. Every object, every symbol, and every shadowed corner tells a part of a larger, unsettling truth.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br>-First Person Walking Simulator<br>-VHS Effects<br>-Puzzles and Cryptic Messages<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681480/extras/fb1e2b2f73914c064bbfa4eca2edd24f.avif?t=1748654991\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><strong>Total Playtime:</strong><br>20-30 Minutes<br><br><br><strong>Future:</strong><br><br><br>Chapter One is available now for free. <strong>Chapter Two is currently in development.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
